{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >type your fingers off, trying to defend yourself and feel like a wannabe hacker in this fast paced typing game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hold your ground against ever growing waves of new and different enemies, with unique mechanics, varying in the movement, the way you have to spell them, or... well you will see\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy new commands to type in, to use against the enemies in strategic ways</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the roguelike system allows you to start over, still with all your bought commands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when leveling up choose a passive upgrade or consumable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > call twitch chat either to help you type or fight it!<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMANDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are many commands to unlock and TYPE IN :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/e01c93dc45a6e0673c7f927dbf9eda78.avif?t=1768122088\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can buy upgrades to get longer runs :)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/95afcb96aa34f641e439b56a48daef4c.avif?t=1768122088\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>CHALLENGE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >challenge leaders to a fight </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/d380c0531cb3f3188269ea6f4751542a.avif?t=1768122088\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if you love typing and seek a challenge or want to learn to spell, this game is for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >global leaderboard! compete with other players for the top score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>tho this game is not for everyone, be warned, true skill comes from practice</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bad Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/4d6a486e1711fd86565e6896fdedb8d13b8abb4f.jpg"},{"name":"Fallout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/cdf7123a3ac21c83dc0f113a24184d8d856fbb7e.jpg"},{"name":"One Rocket, Shared Equally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/751a52f90a64861121f92a80a79ee5bb9579d84c.jpg"},{"name":"Domination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/fc54a2f2e800e68fccdb379665beb46083253b76.jpg"},{"name":"You will TRY...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/0ab4404d2bf9706968342cde7a8dd7fcae1e0298.jpg"},{"name":"No more Tariffs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/62e04c7f6970a3bb0f0b6779fa6547a08b1c2624.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial Passed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884500/27f0d1b72cef01821e98cb0d98fcf6496fa94f97.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884500?t=1768122088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884500?t=1768122088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/9eccf4da2ce0a55d84a34